Durák — third-party material
============================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in this repository. Two things in it
came from elsewhere or carry their own terms.

Playing card artwork — src/client/cards/decks/classic/
------------------------------------------------------
SVG Playing Cards by Daniel S. Fowler, https://tekeye.uk
Dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

The dedication is recorded in the RDF metadata of the files themselves, not
merely claimed on a web page:

    <cc:license rdf:resource="http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/" />
    <dc:rights><cc:Agent><dc:title>Public Domain</dc:title>

CC0 requires no attribution. It is given here, in ASSETS.md and in the footer of
the application because it is the decent thing to do. ASSETS.md records the
provenance check in full, including the three of fifty-four faces whose metadata
is incomplete and why that is an oversight rather than a different licence.

Playing card artwork — src/client/cards/decks/minimal/
-------------------------------------------------------
Generated by tools/make-minimal-deck.ts and part of this project, so the MIT
licence above applies to it like any other file here.

Typefaces
---------
The three visual styles name Caprasimo, Figtree, Space Grotesk and Playfair
Display, all served from Google Fonts and all under the SIL Open Font License.
None of them is redistributed here; every stack ends in a system fallback, so
the application works without them.
